    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nIntroducing Donaghcumper Gate, a new development of beautifully designed 2 and 3 bedroom homes coming soon to Celbridge, Co. Kildare. Set just off the Dublin Road, Celbridge's most sought-after locations, Donaghcumper Gate offers the ideal balance of contemporary living and natural surroundings. Residents can enjoy the best of both town and country, with excellent schools, boutique shops, cafés, parks and sports facilities all within easy reach, while Dublin is conveniently accessible via road and rail. From the historic splendour of Donaghcumper and Castletown House to the scenic riverside walks along the River Liffey, Celbridge provides an outstanding quality of life for families, first-time buyers and those looking to downsize. Register your interest today and be among the first to receive exclusive launch information.\n\nFor more information, please contact Sherry FitzGerald Brady O'Flaherty on 01 651 0000 or Sherry FitzGerald New Homes on 01 667 1888."
      },
